{"id":46593,"vol":{"id":4955,"name":"Catwoman"},"num":"77","name":"No Man's Land 6: Pay Back","title":"Catwoman #77","year":"2000","date":"2000-02-01","store":"","poster":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/0/4/41286-4955-46593-1-catwoman.jpg","big":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/0/4/41286-4955-46593-1-catwoman.jpg","pub":"DC Comics","deck":"","desc":"Mercy may have stepped on the kitty's tail in CATWOMAN #74, but the Feline Fatale is going to go her one better in a battle royal!\n\nUsing the stolen battlesuitts from Luthor Catwoman uses them to blow up Luthor's work camp. The Penguin tries to double cross Catwoman but she is one step ahead of him and destroys his warehouse. Catwoman continues to tamper with Luthor's workforce and equipment simply to frustrate him and further her personal vendetta with Mercy.","people":[{"id":23086,"name":"Albert DeGuzman","role":"letterer"},{"id":51303,"name":"Frank Berrios","role":"editor"},{"id":19325,"name":"Jim Balent","role":"penciler, cover"},{"id":41827,"name":"John Ostrander","role":"writer"},{"id":3571,"name":"Marlo Alquiza","role":"inker"},{"id":40984,"name":"Matt Idelson","role":"editor"},{"id":44255,"name":"Roberta Tewes","role":"colorist"}],"chars":[{"id":1698,"name":"Catwoman","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11156/111564182/9945025-catwoman-85-main-fiumara-1.jpg"},{"id":1699,"name":"Batman","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11144/111442876/8759934-jrjrhr.jpg"},{"id":41952,"name":"Lex Luthor","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11114/111147698/9514001-superman-lex-luthor-special-1-melnikov.jpg"}],"arcs":[{"id":42106,"name":"\"Batman\" No Man's Land"}]}